Native app security/no-claim proof:

- Child copy avoids blame, AI attribution, process names, private paths, and
  parent-only diagnostics.
- Child-facing payloads reject private diagnostic refs.
- Ask-parent/request-more-time requires approval, evidence, child reason, and
  child status refs.
- Manual-required/unavailable states cannot carry adapter action refs.
- No raw process paths, command lines, child content, screenshots, raw journal
  rows, SQLite rows, or tokens are introduced by this slice.
